,743) excluded as a separately labelled line. capex = 'Acquisition of Property, Plant & Equipment' only (7,568,921,055) -- no separate intangible asset acquisition line in this filing; this single capex line is unusually large this quarter (vs 433,114,203 a year earlier) reflecting the ongoing BESS (Battery Energy Storage System) build-out across 13 sites disclosed in the MD's message (pg.2). total_liabilities uses the segmental note's independently-stated Group total (25,410,021,383, pg.10) rather than summing Total Non-Current Liabilities (22,559,174,137) + Total Current Liabilities (2,850,847,246) = 25,410,021,383 from the balance sheet, which match exactly -- both sources agree. cash_from_operations is sharply negative this quarter (-6,820,472,146, vs -711,359,020 prior year) almost entirely due to a Rs.8,682,342,791 increase in trade & other receivables ('Project Advances & Other Receivables' on the balance sheet rose from 1,674,648,990 to 9,792,209,995), consistent with cash advances made for the BESS project construction -- a working-capital, not profitability, item."}], "financials_annual": [], "market_data": {"symbol": "WIND", "as_of": "2026-08-25", "collected_at": "2026-08-25T07:00:08.145699", "price": 40.4, "previous_close": 40.4, "closing_price": 40.4, "open": 40.5, "high": 40.5, "low": 40.3, "turnover": 725464.6, "share_volume": 17954.0, "market_cap": 54751186515.6, "shares_outstanding": 1355227389.0, "source": "tradeSummary", "valuation": null}, "thesis": null, "ratios": {"GROUP": []}, "report_diff": {"GROUP": []}, "interim_updates": [], "shareholder_info": null, "price_history": [{"as_of": "2026-07-14", "price": 40.9, "closing_price": 40.9}, {"as_of": "2026-07-15", "price": 40.9, "closing_price": 40.9}, {"as_of": "2026-07-16", "price": 40.7, "closing_price": 40.7}, {"as_of": "2026-07-17", "price": 40.7, "closing_price": 40.7}, {"as_of": "2026-07-18", "price": 40.8, "closing_price": 40.8}, {"as_of": "2026-07-19", "price": 40.8, "closing_price": 40.8}, 